# =========================================================================
# 规则集名称: Twitter / X 专属规则集 (经典 Classical 格式)
# 适用平台: Mihomo / Clash.Meta (RULE-SET) & Shadowrocket (小火箭)
# 维护仓库: https://github.com/yezi98/meta-rules
# 核心作用: 覆盖 Twitter / X 全矩阵核心信令、GraphQL API (回帖/评论区)、
#           多媒体图片/视频 CDN、短链接与官方子域，杜绝机房风控与回帖报错
# =========================================================================

# === 1. Twitter / X 核心主站与短链接 ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twttr.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twttr.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twitpic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vine.co
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,twitter

# === 2. 媒体与静态资源 CDN 节点 ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twimg.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twimg.org
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,twimg

# === 3. 直播与实时通信业务 ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,periscope.tv
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pscp.tv

# === 4. xAI 人工智能生态 ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
